[This is a BF program for bf-gui.]
[It paints 8 colour bands (one row of 256 pixels each) and then]
[waits for any key to exit.  Only BF instructions matter; all]
[other characters are ignored by the interpreter.]

[RGB332 layout:]
[  bits 7-5  red   (0-7)]
[  bits 4-2  green (0-7)]
[  bits 1-0  blue  (0-3)]

[Row 0  red    0xE0]
[Row 1  green  0x1C]
[Row 2  blue   0x03]
[Row 3  yellow 0xFC]
[Row 4  magenta 0xE3]
[Row 5  cyan   0x1F]
[Row 6  white  0xFF]
[Row 7  black  0x00]

